{start_of_verse: Verso 1}
[C] I stayed in the [F]shadows for a while
[Am] But now the darkness is [G]over, now it's bright
[C] There's nothing I can't [F]do if the sun shinee-[Am]ee-ee-[G]ees

[C] The music now is [F]beating in my heart
[Am] There's a new be[G]ginning taking part
[C] It's something in the [F]air, I feel aliii-[Am]iii-[G]iive
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: Pre-coro}
